      "content": "wait really? that sounds super scary. i dont have insurance right now so a trip to the ER would be crazy expensive. i feel okay otherwise, no pain really, just a little heavy. u sure it's not just inflammation from the walk? i could just take some ibuprofen and keep it elevated for a day or two to see if it goes down?",
